{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Standing still in the woods is a lonely cabin inhabited by one man. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through his story over a week as he slowly goes insane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you find meaning in this mystery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566280/extras/Gif_area.gif?t=1743353835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Game Loop:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find logs and light your fire. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your can opener and munch on some beans. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get scared!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sleep in your cozy bed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566280/extras/Gif_store_Gameplay.gif?t=1743353835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Packed with jump scares. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized graphics to help immerse you in his story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different unique events per day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many Easter eggs to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have fun and enjoy!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566280?t=1743353835","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566280?t=1743353835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste